&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &quot;Offset&quot; option, which will display if the collection exports to a codec with the &lt;code&gt;support_offset&lt;/code&gt; field set to &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
